difficult or disengaged, we need to look

1365
02:07:01,143 --> 02:07:05,873
carefully at the context, the relationship
and the opportunities they

1366
02:07:05,874 --> 02:07:11,022
have been offered to contribute. Our
intention matters, and so does how the

1367
02:07:11,023 --> 02:07:12,621
process is experienced.

1368
